### Conversation Management API Tests

### 1. Create a new conversation for a spy
POST http://localhost:8000/api/conversations
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

spy_id={{spy_id}}

### 2. Chat with conversation context (using conversation_id)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/chat/conversation/{{conversation_id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Hello, can you tell me about your specialty?"
}

### 3. Chat with conversation context - follow-up message
POST http://localhost:8000/api/chat/conversation/{{conversation_id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "What did we just talk about?"
}

### 4. Get conversation details
GET http://localhost:8000/api/conversations/{{conversation_id}}

### Variables to set:
# spy_id: Use an existing spy ID from your database
# conversation_id: Use the conversation ID returned from step 1
